<p>Deploy a hidden spring-loaded catapult that will trigger (by pressure) for any creature passing over it.  Victims will be knocked back towards a target location up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> grids away and be dazed for 5 turns.</p><p>This trap has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">89%, 91%, 92%, 93%, 94%</acronym> chance to reset itself after triggering, but can only trigger once per turn.</p><p>The chance to affect the target improves with your combat accuracy.</p>